.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-doctor 1 "" "Sway Things 0.0.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-doctor \- Check why settings might not take effect: the compositor, your sway config and its include line, the settings files, the generated files and the lines of your config that win
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things doctor\fR [\fB\-\-fix\fR] [\fB\-\-overwrite\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check why settings might not take effect: the compositor, your sway config and its include line, the settings files, the generated files and the lines of your config that win
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-fix\fR
Write the generated files that are missing or out of date. Never touches your own files
.TP
\fB\-\-overwrite\fR
With \-\-fix, also replace generated files that were changed outside Sway Things
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print JSON for scripts
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
